This repository vendors no third-party source. Third-party dependencies are
resolved at build time and retain their own licenses; see pnpm-lock.yaml for
the JavaScript tree and runtimes/*/Dockerfile for the container images.

One of those dependencies is published by mWater: ez-localize
(https://github.com/mWater/ez-localize), a public open-source localization
library under Apache 2.0. It is installed from npm at build time like every
other dependency, and its source is not in this repository.

The @mwater/integration-runner npm package and the
ghcr.io/mwater/integration-runtime-* container images are built from
packages/runner and runtimes/ in this repository. Their names say where they
are published, not that they contain other code.

apps/server/static/boundaries/ contains country boundaries derived from
Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), which is in the public
domain.
